<doc id="79819" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79819" title="Topaz">
Topaz

Topaz ya iku &lt;a href="mineral%20silikat"&gt;mineral silikat&lt;/a&gt; kang kasusun saka &lt;a href="aluminium"&gt;aluminium&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="fluorin"&gt;fluorin&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="formula%20kimia"&gt;formula kimia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="aluminium"&gt;Al&lt;/a&gt;2&lt;a href="silikon"&gt;Si&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="oksigen"&gt;O&lt;/a&gt;4(&lt;a href="fluorin"&gt;F&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="hidroksida"&gt;OH&lt;/a&gt;)2. Topaz ngristal ana ing wujud &lt;a href="ortorombik"&gt;ortorombik&lt;/a&gt; lan sapérangan &lt;a href="kristal"&gt;kristal&lt;/a&gt;e wujudé prisma kang pucuke piramida utawa wujud liyané. Topaz murni ora ana wernane utawa transparan nanging racaké diwarnai déning impuritas; topaz biase wernane kuning, klawu enom utawa uga jingga kemerahan, lan biru cokelat. Saliyané iku ana uka kang wernane putih, &lt;a href="ijo%20enom"&gt;ijo enom&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="biru"&gt;biru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="emas"&gt;emas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="abang%20jambu"&gt;abang jambu&lt;/a&gt; (langka), &lt;a href="kuning"&gt;kuning&lt;/a&gt; rada &lt;a href="abang"&gt;abang&lt;/a&gt; utawa opak nganti tekan transparan. Topaz sok digandhengake karo watu beku &lt;a href="silisik"&gt;silisik&lt;/a&gt; jinis &lt;a href="granit"&gt;granit&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="riolit"&gt;riolit&lt;/a&gt;. Mineral iki dadi kristal ana ing jerone &lt;a href="pegmatit"&gt;pegmatit&lt;/a&gt; granit utawa bolongan uwab ana ing aliran lava riolit kaya ing Pegunungan Topaz sisih kulon &lt;a href="Utah"&gt;Utah&lt;/a&gt;. Topaz bisa tinemu karo &lt;a href="fluorit"&gt;fluorit&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kasiterit"&gt;kasiterit&lt;/a&gt; ana ing manéka warna nagara kalebu ana ing &lt;a href="Pegunungan%20Ural"&gt;Pegunungan Ural&lt;/a&gt; lan Ilmen ing Nagara &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afghanistan"&gt;Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Ceko"&gt;Républik Ceko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brazil"&gt;Brazil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Meksiko"&gt;Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pulau%20Flinders"&gt;Pulau Flinders&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nigeria"&gt;Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng "topaz" asalé saka tembnung (&lt;a href="Lama%20Perancis"&gt;Lama Perancis&lt;/a&gt;: Topace lan &lt;a href="Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Topazus) saka &lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; Τοπάζιος (Τοpáziοs) utawa Τοπάζιον(Τοpáziοn), jeneng kuna saka &lt;a href="St%20John%20Pulau%2C%20Mesir"&gt;Pulo St John&lt;/a&gt; ana ing &lt;a href="Laut%20Merah"&gt;Laut Merah&lt;/a&gt;.
