Enny Beatrice (lair ing &lt;a href="Tegal"&gt;Tegal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;). Enny Beatrice iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Enny Beatrice duwé jeneng asli Enny Beatrice Ferlat Kusumo Anggraini. Enny Beatrice tau akting ing filem kang judhulé "Perawan Rimba" lan "Nyi Blorong". Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="13%20Juni"&gt;13 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;, Enny Beatrice nikah karo &lt;a href="Mantri"&gt;Mantri&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pariwisata"&gt;Pariwisata&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt; kang jenengé &lt;a href="Dato"&gt;Dato&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Seri"&gt;Seri&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tengku%20Adnan%20Mansor"&gt;Tengku Adnan Mansor&lt;/a&gt;.
Saiki, Enny Beatrice urip ing &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Enny Beatrice nduwé anak kang cacahé sepuluh. Anak kang cacahé papat iku anak saka asil pernikahané Tengku Adnan karo mantan bojoné kang sepisanan nalika durung nikah karo Enny Beatrice. Saka asil pernikahané karo &lt;a href="Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, Enny nduwé anak kang cacahé enem. Anak-anaké Enny Beatrice ya iku &lt;a href="Tengku%20Iqbal%20Munawir%20Bin%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Iqbal Munawir Bin Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tengku%20Natasja%20Putri%20Bte%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Natasja Putri Bte Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tengku%20Muhamed%20Hafiz%20Bin%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Muhamed Hafiz Bin Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tengku%20Nadirah%20Munawarah%20Bte%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Nadirah Munawarah Bte Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tengku%20Najwa%20Munawarah%20Bte%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Najwa Munawarah Bte Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Tengku%20Nabila%20Putri%20Bte%20Tengku%20Adnan"&gt;Tengku Nabila Putri Bte Tengku Adnan&lt;/a&gt;.
Saiki Enny luwih sibuk mèlu organisasi sosial kang anggotané bojoné mantri lan wakil mantri Malaysia. Sanajan wis ora main filem manèh. Enny isih aktif ing donyaning seni. Bojoné Enny uga bisa nampa Enny kang isih seneng nari. Nalika nikah karo Datuk, Enny dadi mualaf. Enny uga pindah dadi warga nagara ing Malaysia nalika taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;.
