Enny Haryono (#ALIH). Enny Haryono nduwéni jeneng asli Ennie Hartati. Enny Haryono iku salah sijiné penyanyi lan juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt; lan 1980-an. Enny dikenal dadi artis kang ramah karo kabèh wong.
Enny Haryono miwiti kariré nalika mèlu lomba Bintang Radio lan Televisi nalika taun &lt;a href="1974"&gt;1974&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé iku, Enny Haryono banjur main filem. Enny tau dadi pemeran utama ing filem kang judhulé &lt;a href="Tiga%20Cewek%20Badung"&gt;Tiga Cewek Badung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%28Cintaku%20di%29%20Kampus%20Biru"&gt;Cintaku di Kampus Biru&lt;/a&gt; bareng karo aktor &lt;a href="Roy%20Marten"&gt;Roy Marten&lt;/a&gt; lan "Tiga Cewek Indian" bareng karo &lt;a href="Rae%20Sita"&gt;Rae Sita&lt;/a&gt;.
Enny Haryono nikah karo Agus Edward Rantung kang nduwéni profesi dadi &lt;a href="pegawe%20negri"&gt;pegawe negri&lt;/a&gt;. Saka pernikahané karo &lt;a href="Agus%20Edward%20Rantung"&gt;Agus Edward Rantung&lt;/a&gt;, Enny Haryono nduwéni anak kang cacahé loro, jenenge ya iku &lt;a href="Renny%20Desita%20Rantung"&gt;Renny Desita Rantung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ricky%20Indrawan%20Rantung"&gt;Ricky Indrawan Rantung&lt;/a&gt;. Enny Haryono saiki nduwéni usaha &lt;a href="garmen"&gt;garmen&lt;/a&gt; bareng karo seduluré. Saliyané usaha garmen, Enny uga nduwé usaha home indhustri batu onik kang manggon ing &lt;a href="Tulungagung"&gt;Tulungagung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawa%20Timur"&gt;Jawa Timur&lt;/a&gt;.
Wiwit SMP, Enny Haryono dadi penyanyi. Enny Haryono uga tau akting ing filem "Ateng The Godfather" nalika taun &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;, "Gara Gara Janda Kaya" nalika taun &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;, "Menentang Maut" (1978), "Primitip" (1978). Enny uga tau akting karo komedian kang jenengé &lt;a href="Dono"&gt;Dono&lt;/a&gt;.
