Aurelie Moeremans uga tau dadi para ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé D'LOVE bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Ahmad%20Albar"&gt;Ahmad Albar&lt;/a&gt;.
