<doc id="80206" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=80206" title="Indah Kalalo">
Indah Kalalo

Indah Kalalo (#ALIH) iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="modhel"&gt;modhel&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; kang nggabung ing &lt;a href="Look%20Models"&gt;Look Models&lt;/a&gt;. Indah Kalalo wis akèh dadi bintang ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;. Film lan sinétron kang tau dibintangi Indah Kalalo kaya ta &lt;a href="Pesan%20Dari%20Surga"&gt;Pesan Dari Surga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Belahan%20Jiwa"&gt;Belahan Jiwa&lt;/a&gt;, Aku Bukan Aku, Taubat, Malin Kundang dan Miss Lina. Dhewe'e uga nate dadi &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; Indonesian Models (&lt;a href="Indosiar"&gt;Indosiar&lt;/a&gt;), Good Morning On The Week End lan Indosat Super Show (&lt;a href="Trans%20TV"&gt;Trans TV&lt;/a&gt;). Saliyané akting, Indah Kalalo uga njajal karir ing nyanyi. Indah Kalalo banjur dhuet karo band anyaran kang jenengé Taka. Indah Kalalo dhuet karo Teka kanthi nyanyi lagu Hanya Untukmu.
Indah Kalalo tau duwé gayutan karo &lt;a href="Carl%20Julieen"&gt;Carl Julieen&lt;/a&gt;. Ananging leloroné banjur putus. Sawisé iku, Indah Kalalo banjur nduwéni gayutan karo &lt;a href="Justin%20Werner"&gt;Justin Werner&lt;/a&gt;. Leloroné duwé rencana bakal nikah nalika sasi September 2011.
Nalika isih cilik, Indah Kalalo iku bocah wadon kang tomboi. Ananging nalika &lt;a href="SMA"&gt;SMA&lt;/a&gt; Indah banjur mèlu-mèlu modelling. Indah uga dadi presenter. Indah Kalalo iku anak saka pasangan &lt;a href="Suyadi%20Mualim"&gt;Suyadi Mualim&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Rose%20Kalalo"&gt;Rose Kalalo&lt;/a&gt;. Indah Kalalo tau dadi presenter ing acara INDONESIAN MODELS (Indosiar), GOOD MORNING ON THE WEEK END dan INDOSAT SUPER SHOW (Trans TV). Nalika sasi Maret 2009, Indah Kalalo uga nduwéni bisnis ing babagan EO lan nggawé single kang judhulé Tak Kusesali. Lagu iki, kalebu lagu lawas kang tau dinyanyekaké karo &lt;a href="Sophia%20Latjuba"&gt;Sophia Latjuba&lt;/a&gt;.
