Lintang ingkang gadhah sebatan The Muscles saking &lt;a href="Brussels"&gt;Brussels&lt;/a&gt; miwiti kariri saking dados aktor ing filem RUE BARBARE (&lt;a href="1984%29"&gt;1984)&lt;/a&gt; lan MONACO FOREVER (&lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;). Dipunlajengaken filem KICKBOXER (&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;), DOUBLE IMPACT (&lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;), UNIVERSAL SOLDIER (&lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;), NOWHERE TO RUN (&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;), HARD TARGET (&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;), SUDDEN DEATH (&lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;) dan TIMECOP (&lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;).
Van Damme naté gadhah masalah narkoba punika, sampun naté nikah kaping tiga. Istri kaping setungggal inggih punika &lt;a href="Maria%20Rodriguez"&gt;Maria Rodriguez&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1984%29"&gt;1984)&lt;/a&gt;, dipunlajengaken &lt;a href="Cynthia%20Derderian"&gt;Cynthia Derderian&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;), model &lt;a href="Darcy%20LaPier"&gt;Darcy LaPier&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;) lan istri punika aktris &lt;a href="Gladys%20Portugues."&gt;Gladys Portugues.&lt;/a&gt;
