<h2>Panguripan</h2>
Panguripan.
Henry R. Towne ya iku anak saka John Henry lan Maria (Tevis) T. Towne. Henry R. Towne kuliyah ing University of Pennsylvania (sekolah tèhnik lan sains trapan) saka taun &lt;a href="1861"&gt;1861&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1862"&gt;1862&lt;/a&gt;, nanging dhèwèké ora ngrampungaké kuliyahe mau. Banjur, Towne nyambut gawé minangka juru gambar ing Port Richmond Iron Works, kang diduwèni déning IP Morris, Towne &amp; Co. Ing taun &lt;a href="1863"&gt;1863&lt;/a&gt;, Towne ditugasi ndandani &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt; perang sarékat &lt;a href="Massachusetts"&gt;Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="1864"&gt;1864&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1866"&gt;1866&lt;/a&gt;, Towne ngadegaké mesin kanggo memonitor US Navy. Sawisé perang, Towne nyinaoni tèhnik ing &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;. In taun &lt;a href="1868"&gt;1868&lt;/a&gt;, Towne minangka kamitran karo &lt;a href="Linus%20Yale"&gt;Linus Yale&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n"&gt;présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; Yale Lock (kumpeni manufaktur)). Ing taun &lt;a href="1888"&gt;1888&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1889"&gt;1889&lt;/a&gt;, Towne njabat minangka présidhèn saka American Society of Mechanical Engineers. Henry Robinson Towne kawin karo Cora E. White lan tiggal donya tanggal 15 Oktober &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;.
