Nalika taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, Jamie Aditya kapilih dados Presenter Hiburan Terbaik ing Asian TV Awards. Jamie Aditya pikantuk nominasi wonten kategori ingkang sami nalika taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; ngantos &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; Jamie dados presenter ing acara Sync or Swim ingkang dipunwedalaken kaliyan &lt;a href="Discovery%20Channel"&gt;Discovery Channel&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun 2005, Jamie wangsul malih wonten kutha &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika wangsul Jamie Aditya sesarengan kaliyan garwa saha putranipun. Sasampunipun wonten Jakarta, Jamie lajeng makarya wonten jagading musik Indonésia. Nalika taun 2007, Jamie Aditya dados juri acara pencarian bakat &lt;a href="Indonesian%20Idol"&gt;Indonesian Idol&lt;/a&gt; kanggé mangsa tayang ingkang kaping sekawan. Kajawi punika Jamie ugi nyiapaken album solo ingkang gadhah nuansa &lt;a href="soul"&gt;soul&lt;/a&gt;. Jamie Aditya ugi mbiyantu ndamel album grup musik indie saking &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt; kados ta &lt;a href="Rock%20N%20Roll%20Mafia"&gt;Rock N Roll Mafia&lt;/a&gt;. Wonten ing mriki, Jamie Aditya dados vokalis tamu wonten &lt;a href="lagu"&gt;lagu&lt;/a&gt; The S.I.G.I.T kanthi dados backing vokal.
