Wong pribumi Taiwan

Wong pribumi &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="basa%20Tionghoa"&gt;basa Tionghoa&lt;/a&gt;: 原住民; pinyin: yuánzhùmín; Wade-Giles: yüan2-chu4-min2; Tongyong Pinyin: yuánjhùmín; &lt;a href="basa%20Taiwan"&gt;basa Taiwan&lt;/a&gt; Pe̍h-oē-jī: gôan-chū-bîn, teges barès: "wong asli") iku wong bumi utawa wong asli Taiwan. Wong bumi iku kagolong wong &lt;a href="Austronesia"&gt;Austronesia&lt;/a&gt; kang ana ing &lt;a href="Taiwan"&gt;Taiwan&lt;/a&gt;, sadurungé ana &lt;a href="Suku%20Han"&gt;Suku Han&lt;/a&gt; kang imigrasi ing gtaun &lt;a href="1600"&gt;1600&lt;/a&gt;-an. Cacahe wong bumi iku kurang luwih 2% saka 23 yuta saka cacahé wong Taiwan. Lumrahé wong bumi Taiwan urip ing pagunungan la ing lembah rata ing sisih wétan &lt;a href="Pulo%20Taiwan"&gt;Pulo Taiwan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pulo%20Lanyu"&gt;Pulo Lanyu&lt;/a&gt;.
Amarga papan panggonnan kang dinggoni wong bumi Taiwan iku béda-béda, basane, lan budayane uga béda banjur wong bumi Taiwan dipantha-pantha dadi &lt;a href="Wong%20Amis"&gt;Wong Amis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Atayal"&gt;Wong Atayal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Paiwan"&gt;Wong Paiwan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Bunong"&gt;Wong Bunong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Lukai"&gt;Wong Lukai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Puyuma"&gt;Wong Puyuma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Cao"&gt;Wong Cao&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wong%20Saiya"&gt;Wong Saiya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Suku%20Yamai"&gt;Suku Yamai&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Suku%20Pingpu"&gt;Suku Pingpu&lt;/a&gt;.
Kurang luwih ana 1.500 kang urip ing kutha-kutha gedhé kaya ta &lt;a href="Shanghai"&gt;Shanghai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Beijing"&gt;Beijing&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Wuhan"&gt;Wuhan&lt;/a&gt;, uga ing Provinsi &lt;a href="Fujian"&gt;Fujian&lt;/a&gt;.
Wong bumi Taiwan biyèn seneng beburu, nanging saiki akèh kang padha dadi tani nandur &lt;a href="pari"&gt;pari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kenthang"&gt;kenthang&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku uga ana kang ngingoni kéwan, kaya ta &lt;a href="babi"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="wedhus"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="asu"&gt;asu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;.
