<doc id="80604" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=80604" title="James Cameron">
James Cameron

James Cameron utawi ingkang gadhah asma James Francis Cameron inggih punika sutradara, prodhuser filem, panyerat carita, lan editor saking &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; ingkang lair ing &lt;a href="Kapuskasing"&gt;Kapuskasing&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ontario"&gt;Ontario&lt;/a&gt;, ing tanggal &lt;a href="16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt;. Putra saking Samira (prawat, seniman) lan Philip Cameron (insinyur) inggih punika ageng ing &lt;a href="Chippawa"&gt;Chippawa&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="Ontario"&gt;Ontario&lt;/a&gt; lan sekolah ing &lt;a href="Stamford%20Collegiate%20School"&gt;Stamford Collegiate School&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Niagara%20Falls"&gt;Niagara Falls&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun inggih punika &lt;a href="atheis"&gt;atheis&lt;/a&gt;. James Cameron ageng ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;. Cameron lan kulawargi punika pindhah ing &lt;a href="Brea"&gt;Brea&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; ing umur &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; taun. Cameron naté sekolah ing &lt;a href="Fullerton%20College"&gt;Fullerton College&lt;/a&gt; jurusan &lt;a href="Fisika"&gt;Fisika&lt;/a&gt;, saderengipun ing pungkasan pindah ing basa &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, nanging piyambakipun medal ing taun &lt;a href="1974"&gt;1974&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun punika, Cameron naté nyambut damel dados sopir truk lan dados panyerat, saderengipun debut ing donya filem ing taun &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;.
Cameron naté krama kaping 5. Asma-asma mantan garwanipun inggih punika &lt;a href="Sharon%20Williams"&gt;Sharon Williams&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Gale%20Anne%20Hurd"&gt;Gale Anne Hurd&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Kathryn%20Bigelow"&gt;Kathryn Bigelow&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Linda%20Hamilton"&gt;Linda Hamilton&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Suzy%20Amis"&gt;Suzy Amis&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipunnikahi ing taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Cameron gadhah putri saking &lt;a href="Linda%20Hamilton"&gt;Linda Hamilton&lt;/a&gt;, kalih putra lan satunggal putri saking &lt;a href="Suzy%20Amis"&gt;Suzy Amis&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun inggih punika anggota saking &lt;a href="NASA%20Advisory%20Council"&gt;NASA Advisory Council&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mars%20Society"&gt;Mars Society&lt;/a&gt;. Cameron gesangipun ing &lt;a href="Malibu"&gt;Malibu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;.
