Bon Jovi inggih punika salah satunggalipun grup musik rock saking &lt;a href="New%20Jersey"&gt;New Jersey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ngadhahi personel &lt;a href="Jon%20Bon%20Jovi"&gt;Jon Bon Jovi&lt;/a&gt; (vokal/gitar), &lt;a href="Richie%20Sambora"&gt;Richie Sambora&lt;/a&gt; (gitar), &lt;a href="Tico%20Torres"&gt;Tico Torres&lt;/a&gt; (drum), &lt;a href="David%20Bryan"&gt;David Bryan&lt;/a&gt; (keyboard) lan &lt;a href="Hugh%20McDonald"&gt;Hugh McDonald&lt;/a&gt; (bas). Lan anggota ingkang sampun medal, &lt;a href="Alec%20John%20Such"&gt;Alec John Such&lt;/a&gt;.
Sapanunggalipun punika Bon Jovi lan musisi-musisi ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; naté gadhah acara kanggé prastawa &lt;a href="9"&gt;9&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt;, inggih punika prastawa bom gedhong &lt;a href="WTC"&gt;WTC&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="teroris"&gt;teroris&lt;/a&gt;. Musisi-musisi wau inggih punika &lt;a href="David%20Bryan"&gt;David Bryan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tico%20Torres"&gt;Tico Torres&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Richie%20Sambora"&gt;Richie Sambora&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kid%20Rock"&gt;Kid Rock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maroon%205"&gt;Maroon 5&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lady%20Antebellum"&gt;Lady Antebellum&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir Bon Jovi</h2>
Karir Bon Jovi.
Bon Jovi pikantuk &lt;a href="Grammy"&gt;Grammy&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; kanggé Best Country Collaboration kanggé tembang Who Says You Can't Go Home. Lan sadèrèngipun punika ing taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; band puniki dados nominasi &lt;a href="Grammy%20Award"&gt;Grammy Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggé It's My Life.
Albumipun Bon Jovi dipunkinten sampun kasadé &lt;a href="35"&gt;35&lt;/a&gt; yuta ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="120"&gt;120&lt;/a&gt; yuta ing donya wiwit taun &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, Bon Jovi ngrilis album kanthi irah-irahan Bounce. Ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; album punika pikantuk &lt;a href="Gold"&gt;Gold&lt;/a&gt;.
Kasuksèsan Bon Jovi dipunlajengaken ing album Have A Nice Day (&lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;) lan Lost Highway (&lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;). Kekalih album punika pikantuk &lt;a href="Platinum"&gt;Platinum&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Canada"&gt;Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.
