<doc id="80742" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=80742" title="John Mayer">
John Mayer

John Mayer ingkang gadhah asma lair John Clayton Mayer inggih punika salah satunggalipun aktor, penyanyi, lan musisi saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan &lt;a href="Fairfield"&gt;Fairfield&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Connecticut"&gt;Connecticut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;. Mayer misuwur amargi album Room For Squares (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;) ingkang dipunlajengaken kanthi album Heavier Things (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;). Piyambakipun naté batal debut ing Music Festival ing &lt;a href="Las%20Vegas"&gt;Las Vegas&lt;/a&gt;, sareng kaliyan &lt;a href="Tony%20Bennett"&gt;Tony Bennett&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;. Sapanunggalipun punika album John Mayer Born and Raised ingkang badhé dipunrilis, dipunundur amargi piyambakipun gerah.
<h2>Karir John Mayer</h2>
Karir John Mayer.
Album solo piyambakipun ingkang no satunggal inggih punika Inside Wants Out (&lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;), saderengipun album kekalih ing ngandhap. Dipunlajengaken kaliyan album Any Given Thursday (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), Heavier Things (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), As/Is (&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;), Continuum (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;) lan The Village Sessions (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;).
Ing taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, Mayer gadhah penghargaan Best Male Pop Vocal Performance saking &lt;a href="Grammy%20Award"&gt;Grammy Award&lt;/a&gt; kanggé tembang Your Body Is a Wonderland. Lan ing taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, kanggé single Waiting on the World to Change ing album Continuum (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;). Piyambakipun gadhah sebatan dados Best Pop Vocal Album lan Best Male Pop Vocal Performance ing Annual &lt;a href="Grammy%20Awards"&gt;Grammy Awards&lt;/a&gt; ing-&lt;a href="49"&gt;49&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
Mayer sareng kaliyan &lt;a href="Pino%20Palladino"&gt;Pino Palladino&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Steve%20Jordan"&gt;Steve Jordan&lt;/a&gt; gadhah trio ingkang dipunparingi asma &lt;a href="John%20Mayer%20Trio"&gt;John Mayer Trio&lt;/a&gt;.
