Riyo Mori (森 理世, Mori Riyo) miyos &lt;a href="24%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;24 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Aoi-ku%2C%20Shizuoka"&gt;Aoi-ku&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shizuoka%2C%20Shizuoka"&gt;Shizuoka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; inggih punika penari balet lan ugi instruktur jogèd saking &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenenganipun dados &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202007"&gt;Miss Universe&lt;/a&gt; ing tanggal &lt;a href="29%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;29 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;..
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Amargi ibunipun gadhah kursus kelas &lt;a href="jog%C3%A8d"&gt;jogèd&lt;/a&gt;, wiwit alit Mori gadhah gegayuhan dados penari. Riyo Mori wasis &lt;a href="dansa"&gt;dansa&lt;/a&gt; wiwit yuswa sekawan taun.
Panjenenganipun sinau ing Quinte Ballet School of Canada lan &lt;a href="Centennial%20Secondary%20School"&gt;Centennial Secondary School&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Belleville%2C%20%0AOntario"&gt;Belleville&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ontario"&gt;Ontario&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenenganipun dados tiyang èstri saking &lt;a href="Asia"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt; ingkang sepisanan menang gelar Miss Universe awit taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun &lt;a href="Miss%20India"&gt;Miss India&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lara%20Dutta"&gt;Lara Dutta&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenenganipun ugi dados tiyang èstri kaping kalih saking &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun &lt;a href="Akiko%20Kojima"&gt;Akiko Kojima&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dados Miss Universe ing taun &lt;a href="1959"&gt;1959&lt;/a&gt;.
Mori dados tiyang èstri Jepang kapisan ingkang lulus ujian mlebet program intensif mangsa panas kelompok jogèd &lt;a href="The%20Rockettes"&gt;The Rockettes&lt;/a&gt; (The Rockettes Summer Intensive). Mori punika lulusan sekolah balet &lt;a href="Quinte%20Ballet%20School%20of%20Canada"&gt;Quinte Ballet School of Canada&lt;/a&gt;, lan sekolah manengah Centennial Secondary School ing &lt;a href="Belleville%2C%20Ontario"&gt;Belleville, Ontario&lt;/a&gt;, Kanada.
<h2>Miss Universe 2007</h2>
