<doc id="80808" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=80808" title="Taira no Kiyomori">
Taira no Kiyomori

Taira no Kiyomori (平 清盛, Taira no Kiyomori) (&lt;a href="1118"&gt;1118&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="20%20Maret"&gt;20 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1181"&gt;1181&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku &lt;a href="samurai"&gt;samurai&lt;/a&gt; kang njabat kepala &lt;a href="klan%20Taira"&gt;klan Taira&lt;/a&gt; ana ing pungkasan &lt;a href="Jaman%20Heian"&gt;Jaman Heian&lt;/a&gt;. Kiyomori ya iku samurai pisanan kang diangkat dadi pejabat tinggi kang dijenengi &lt;a href="Daij%C5%8D%20Daijin"&gt;Daijō Daijin&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawisé jasa ana ing &lt;a href="Pambrontakan%20H%C5%8Dgen"&gt;Pambrontakan Hōgen&lt;/a&gt;, Kiyomori olej ijin saka &lt;a href="Kaisar%20Goshirakawa"&gt;Kaisar Goshirakawa&lt;/a&gt; kanggo matèni &lt;a href="Minamoto%20no%20Yoshitomo"&gt;Minamoto no Yoshitomo&lt;/a&gt; kang nglancarake &lt;a href="Pambrontakan%20Heiji"&gt;Pambrontakan Heiji&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé njabat Daijō Daijin, klan Taira kang dipimpine bisa dadi kalan kang paling nguwasani Jepang. Kakuwasan pamrantahan sakabehe ana ing tangane klan klan Taira sawisé Kaisar Goshirakawa dinyatakake dadi tahanan omah.
Nalika jaman semana, anggota klan Taira banjur umuk lan ngetokaké istilah,Heishi ni arazumba hito ni arazu. Rasa umuk saka klan taira iki nyebabake rasa ora puas saka kalangan samurai. Nalika wadyabala &lt;a href="klan%20Minamoto"&gt;klan Minamoto&lt;/a&gt; nglancarake pambrontakan kanggo ngalahake klan Taira, Kiyomori mati amarga lara demam lan panas dhuwur.
Taira no Kiyomori lair ana ing &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Ise"&gt;Provinsi Ise&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1118"&gt;1118&lt;/a&gt; saka pewaris kepala &lt;a href="klan%20Ise%20Taira"&gt;klan Ise Taira&lt;/a&gt; kang jenenge &lt;a href="Taira%20no%20Tadamori"&gt;Taira no Tadamori&lt;/a&gt;. Ibune duwé jeneng Gion Nyogo kang makarya dadi punggawa pura, utawa adhine saka Gion Nyogo (nyogo ya iku gelar kanggo wong wadon kang makarya ana ing pura). Miturut kisah &lt;a href="Heike%20Monogatari"&gt;Heike Monogatari&lt;/a&gt;, Kiyomori ya iku bayi saka kasil gayutan &lt;a href="Kaisar%20Shirakawa"&gt;Kaisar Shirakawa&lt;/a&gt; karo Gion Nyogo kang diwènèhake marang Taira no Tadamori.
Taun &lt;a href="1129"&gt;1129&lt;/a&gt;, bapake Kiyomori munggah pangkat dadi pejabat dhuwur kang tingkate &lt;a href="Jugoige"&gt;Jugoige&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé bisa numpas komplotan bajak laut, bapake Kiyomori ditunjuk dadi &lt;a href="Gy%C5%8Dbush%C5%8D"&gt;Gyōbukyō&lt;/a&gt; lan kalungguhan iki kang mengkone diwarisake marang Kiyomori kang ditunjuk dadi panguwasa &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Aki"&gt;Provinsi Aki&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1146"&gt;1146&lt;/a&gt;.
